OL,3,GNEWSADriver dies after car crashes into
OL,4,Abuilding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 60s has died after his car
OL,7,Fcrashed into a building, police have
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FKent Police said the crash in Hythe
OL,11,FHigh Street happened shortly before
OL,12,F19:30 BST on Wednesday, and the driver
OL,13,Fwas confirmed to have died at the
OL,14,Fscene.
OL,16,FA police spokesperson said the man's
OL,17,Fdeath was not being treated as
OL,18,Fsuspicious, and his next of kin had
OL,19,Fbeen informed.
OL,21,F"A report has been completed for the
OL,22,Fcoroner," the force added.
